        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>99Managers</strong> is a sports management game, and this is the Futsal Edition, the first in the series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run real futsal matches with a real-time 2D match engine, then take full control with an in-game editor. Customize players, teams, and competitions. And since it’s open source, you can get the full source code and make it yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>2D match engine</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Watch full matches or just the highlights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Influence outcomes by changing players and tactics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simulate matches and get final results instantly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/139c4e3a9363ad2f61ffd9969594acee.poster.avif?t=1785065669\" aria-label=\"The match engine showing a goal.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/139c4e3a9363ad2f61ffd9969594acee.webm?t=1785065669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/139c4e3a9363ad2f61ffd9969594acee.mp4?t=1785065669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Data pack editor</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create custom data packs and share them with others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize competitions, and build your own leagues and cups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create teams, use logos, and edit player attributes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/55d7a73cbe331abc93eb9a4d8cbd1d02.poster.avif?t=1785065669\" aria-label=\"The in-game editor.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/55d7a73cbe331abc93eb9a4d8cbd1d02.webm?t=1785065669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/55d7a73cbe331abc93eb9a4d8cbd1d02.mp4?t=1785065669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Join the community</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Because your feedback matters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Report bugs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Improve translations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Contribute fixes and features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/745752dd10b396117e6801b6c8314d79.avif?t=1785065669\" alt=\"99Managers Futsal Edition + Godot Engine\" width=780 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Made with <strong>Godot Engine 4</strong> and <strong>much love</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>99Managers</strong> is a sports management game, and this is the Futsal Edition, the first in the series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run real futsal matches with a real-time 2D match engine, then take full control with an in-game editor. Customize players, teams, and competitions. And since it’s open source, you can get the full source code and make it yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>2D match engine</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Watch full matches or just the highlights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Influence outcomes by changing players and tactics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simulate matches and get final results instantly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/139c4e3a9363ad2f61ffd9969594acee.poster.avif?t=1785065669\" aria-label=\"The match engine showing a goal.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/139c4e3a9363ad2f61ffd9969594acee.webm?t=1785065669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/139c4e3a9363ad2f61ffd9969594acee.mp4?t=1785065669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Data pack editor</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create custom data packs and share them with others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize competitions, and build your own leagues and cups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create teams, use logos, and edit player attributes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/55d7a73cbe331abc93eb9a4d8cbd1d02.poster.avif?t=1785065669\" aria-label=\"The in-game editor.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/55d7a73cbe331abc93eb9a4d8cbd1d02.webm?t=1785065669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/55d7a73cbe331abc93eb9a4d8cbd1d02.mp4?t=1785065669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Join the community</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Because your feedback matters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Report bugs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Improve translations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Contribute fixes and features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/extras/745752dd10b396117e6801b6c8314d79.avif?t=1785065669\" alt=\"99Managers Futsal Edition + Godot Engine\" width=780 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Made with <strong>Godot Engine 4</strong> and <strong>much love</strong>.</p>",
